node_modules/
dist/
.env
.env.local
.DS_Store
*.log

# Runtime state, not curated content — snapshots and the append-only
# session log are regenerated locally and grow without bound.
zvapps/.zv-history/
zvapps/telemetry/

# NOTE: the backlog and PRD are intentionally NOT ignored. Backlog items are
# markdown with YAML front-matter precisely so a downstream project commits,
# diffs, and versions them alongside its code — the same for zvapps/PRD.md.
# The template ships an empty backlog (only zvapps/backlog/.gitkeep); your
# cards are yours to commit.
#
# Investiture's OWN five internal cards are excluded on the maintainer machine
# via .git/info/exclude (local, never shipped), not here — so they never leak
# into a generated template. Their system of record is the Notion Roadmap.
